{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>據《WIRED》記者 Julian Chokkattu 報道，Apple 計劃在今年稍後推出的軟件更新中，為 iPhone Duo 加入 Reachability 功能。文章推測該功能會在內螢幕與外螢幕同時提供，但未有明確說明。</p>\n<h2>Reachability 屬輔助使用設定</h2>\n<p>Reachability 屬輔助使用設定，目前已見於其他 iPhone 型號。用戶在螢幕底部邊緣向下滑動，介面上半部便會下移，令畫面上的控制項更容易以單手觸及。至於今年稍後更新的具體日期，以及在內、外螢幕上的實際運作方式，報道未提供進一步細節。</p>\n<img alt=\"與 iPhone Duo 相關的圖片\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/iphone-duo-standby.webp\">\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T13:02:00.852542+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":258,"images":1,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T12:52:55+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T15:57:54.970143+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T12:57:50.145505+00:00","content_hash":"a2e3b81f4be72d29669144fab735ddc8219746103114fa71d2df249cef9c6bf6","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}